          </h2><div class="s-icons-with-text__text"><p><em>1. HORMONAL THINNING (FEMALE PATTERN HAIR LOSS)</em></p><p>Perimenopause, menopause, PCOS, postpartum, coming off the pill: when oestrogen drops, DHT gets the upper hand and the follicles along your part and crown slowly shrink. Pumpkin seed oil’s DHT-blocking sterols target this directly.</p><p><em>2. SHEDDING FROM STRESS, ILLNESS OR RAPID WEIGHT LOSS</em></p><p>Telogen effluvium pushes follicles into their resting phase all at once: handfuls in the shower, a thinner ponytail. Caffeine helps pull follicles back into their growth phase so the shedding slows and regrowth can start.</p><p><em>3. TRACTION, BREAKAGE &amp; ALOPECIA</em></p><p>Years of tight braids, weaves, buns and heat wear down the edges and temples. Autoimmune alopecia leaves patches. Elaren nourishes and calms the scalp so it can support regrowth, and works alongside any treatment your doctor recommends.</p></div><div class="s-icons-with-text__main-icons-wrapper"><div class="s-icons-with-text__main-icon"><div class="s-icons-with-text__main-icon-background">
